{
  "title": "Audi",
  "views": [
    {
      "title": "Vehicle",
      "path": "vehicle",
      "icon": "mdi:car-electric",
      "type": "masonry",
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "vertical-stack",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "# {{ states('sensor.audi_widget_bridge_vehicle_name') }}\nCharge, range and vehicle status from myAudi.\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "columns": 2,
              "square": false,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_battery",
                  "name": "Battery charge",
                  "min": 0,
                  "max": 100,
                  "needle": true,
                  "severity": {
                    "red": 0,
                    "yellow": 20,
                    "green": 40
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "entity",
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_range",
                  "name": "Estimated range",
                  "icon": "mdi:map-marker-distance"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "title": "Vehicle",
              "show_header_toggle": false,
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_vehicle_status",
                  "name": "Vehicle status"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_mileage",
                  "name": "Mileage"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_vehicle_name",
                  "name": "Vehicle name"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "history-graph",
              "title": "Battery \u00b7 last 24 hours",
              "hours_to_show": 24,
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_battery",
                  "name": "Battery charge"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "vertical-stack",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "title": "Contact and updates",
              "show_header_toggle": false,
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_last_vehicle_contact",
                  "name": "Audi vehicle contact"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_widget_received",
                  "name": "Widget captured"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_bridge_delivery",
                  "name": "Sent to Home Assistant"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{% set received = as_datetime(states('sensor.audi_widget_bridge_widget_received'), none) %}\n{% if received %}\n{% set age = ((now() - received).total_seconds() / 60) | int %}\n{% if age >= 120 %}\n**Widget update overdue** \u2014 last captured {{ relative_time(received) }} ago.\n{% else %}\n**Widget last captured {{ relative_time(received) }} ago.**\n{% endif %}\n{% else %}\n**Waiting for a widget reading.**\n{% endif %}\n\nAudi's last vehicle contact: **{{ states('sensor.audi_widget_bridge_last_vehicle_contact') }}**.\n\n{% if state_attr('sensor.audi_widget_bridge_widget_data', 'capture_phase') == 'startup_snapshot' %}\nThe latest reading is a startup snapshot and may contain cached vehicle data.\n{% endif %}\n\nCapture and delivery times show when the phone read and sent the widget. They do not establish when the car last reported new data.\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "history-graph",
              "title": "Range \u00b7 last 24 hours",
              "hours_to_show": 24,
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_range",
                  "name": "Estimated range"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Widget details",
      "path": "widget-details",
      "icon": "mdi:text-box-outline",
      "type": "masonry",
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "## Text supplied by myAudi\n```text\n{{ (state_attr('sensor.audi_widget_bridge_widget_data', 'raw_text') or ['No widget text received.']) | join('\n') }}\n```\n"
        },
        {
          "type": "vertical-stack",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "## Capture details\n- **Capture type:** {{ state_attr('sensor.audi_widget_bridge_widget_data', 'capture_phase') | default('Unknown', true) }}\n- **Phone locked at capture:** {{ state_attr('sensor.audi_widget_bridge_widget_data', 'phone_locked') }}\n- **Screen interactive at capture:** {{ state_attr('sensor.audi_widget_bridge_widget_data', 'screen_interactive') }}\n\nVehicle status is displayed as Audi supplies it. No locked/unlocked interpretation is applied.\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "title": "Bridge diagnostics",
              "show_header_toggle": false,
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_widget_data",
                  "name": "Full widget data \u00b7 tap for attributes"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_widget_received",
                  "name": "Widget captured"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.audi_widget_bridge_bridge_delivery",
                  "name": "Sent to Home Assistant"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
